 ; the foreman, frozen where he fell
 [Prop [[Name FrozenForeman] [Appearance [Some [Composed Body [[Colors [Some [[Clothes Coat] [Skin Pale] [Boots Trousers]]]]]]]] [Place [[At [Some [-3 -3.2]]]]]
   [Interact [Some [[InteractionType Examine] [Cue [If [Flagged [Taken ForemanKeycard]]
                                             [Say ["Gus Brandt, frozen where he fell. The frost's already closing over his face again."]]
                                             [Sequence [[Say ["A man in a supervisor's white coat, curled up frozen against the wall. G. BRANDT, says his badge." "His keycard's clipped to his coat. You work it free of the ice."]] [GiveAs ForemanKeycard Keycard 1]]]]]]]]]]
